WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Mark two lines 1 cm apart.
Add Aari chain stitches just outside both lines.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.200
Come up on the lower line with a hand needle.
Go down 8 mm to the right on the upper line.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Under the fabric, move 2 mm left.
Bring the needle back up on the upper line.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.500
Cross down to the lower line, 4 mm farther right
than the last entry. Come up 2 mm to the left.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:20.050
Alternate lines to form a row of X shapes.
Leave the thread loose enough for the cloth to lie flat.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.000
On the back, weave the thread under two or three
stitches to secure it.
